msgid "Xorg、XDM 与 IceWM"
msgstr "Xorg, XDM, and IceWM"

msgid "会话"
msgstr "Sessions"

msgid ""
"默认图形链为内核、PID 1、Xorg、XDM、IceWM。XDM 完成 PAM 登录后， IceWM 和应用使用普通用户身份运行；不要用 root 桌面代替正常授权。 终端为 "
"st，默认浏览器为 NetSurf。图形载荷使用锁文件中 ``feature=xorg`` 的依赖； 当前 Alpine 基线为 ``v3.24``，Mesa 26.3.0 与 LLVM 23 "
"图形运行库使用 锁定 SHA 和签名的官方 edge APK，以提供未修改的 VirGL 驱动。 准备依赖使用 ``make fetch``。 首次配置及真实运行测试必须区分 QEMU 与 "
"VMware。"
msgstr ""
"The default graphics chain is kernel, PID 1, Xorg, XDM and IceWM. After XDM completes PAM login, "
"IceWM and applications run as the ordinary user; a root desktop is not a replacement for "
"authorization. The terminal is st and the default browser is NetSurf. Graphics payloads use "
"dependencies marked ``feature=xorg`` in the lock file. Alpine ``v3.24`` remains the baseline; "
"Mesa 26.3.0 and LLVM 23 graphics runtime libraries use official edge APKs with pinned hashes and "
"verified signatures to provide unmodified VirGL. Prepare dependencies with ``make fetch``. "
"Distinguish QEMU from VMware for initial configuration and runtime validation."

msgid ""
"Xorg 自动探测设备。在具备已实现 DRM 能力时使用 modesetting/glamor， 否则保留 framebuffer 回退。VMware 保留软件光标与关闭 page flip "
"的默认值； VirtIO-GPU 由 XDM 的 Xorg wrapper 生成 ``/run/X11/xorg-virtio.conf``， 开启硬件光标和 page flip。显式指定 "
"``-config`` 或 ``-configdir`` 时尊重 管理员配置。检查实际 Xorg/Mesa 日志与绘制结果，不能只看显卡名称。"
msgstr ""
"Xorg probes devices automatically, using modesetting/glamor when the implemented DRM capabilities"
" are available and retaining framebuffer fallback otherwise. VMware keeps software cursors and "
"disabled page flips by default. For VirtIO-GPU, the XDM Xorg wrapper generates ``/run/X11/xorg-"
"virtio.conf`` to enable hardware cursors and page flips. Explicit ``-config`` or ``-configdir`` "
"arguments preserve the administrator selection. Check actual Xorg/Mesa logs and rendered pixels "
"rather than relying on the GPU name."

msgid "VirtIO-GPU 运行"
msgstr "Running VirtIO-GPU"

msgid "QEMU/KVM 可在原生入口选择 2D 或 VirGL；不指定时仍使用原来的 VGA::"
msgstr ""
"The native QEMU/KVM entry point can select 2D or VirGL. Without a selection, the existing VGA "
"default remains::"

msgid ""
"VirGL 默认使用 ``gtk,gl=on``，需要宿主支持 OpenGL 的 QEMU、virglrenderer 和可访问的 render node。可以通过 "
"``QEMU_DISPLAY`` 指定 EGL-headless 等 显示后端。``QEMU_GPU=vmware`` 仍可用于原有 QEMU SVGA 路径。"
msgstr ""
"VirGL defaults to ``gtk,gl=on`` and requires host QEMU with OpenGL support, virglrenderer and an "
"accessible render node. Set ``QEMU_DISPLAY`` to select EGL-headless or another display backend. "
"``QEMU_GPU=vmware`` retains the existing QEMU SVGA path."

msgid ""
"检查 Xorg 日志中的 ``glamor initialized``、``virgl`` 和 DRI2/DRI3 状态。 内核未协商 VirGL 时不提供 render node，不能将软件 "
"renderer 当成硬件加速。 Linux VirtGPU ioctl、legacy KMS、同设备 PRIME 和 sync_file 已实现； atomic "
"KMS、跨设备共享、syncobj、blob 及 Venus/Vulkan 不在当前支持范围。"
msgstr ""
"Check ``glamor initialized``, ``virgl`` and DRI2/DRI3 state in Xorg logs. The kernel does not "
"publish a render node without negotiated VirGL; software rendering is not evidence of hardware "
"acceleration. Linux VirtGPU ioctls, legacy KMS, same-device PRIME and sync_file are implemented. "
"Atomic KMS, cross-device sharing, syncobj, blobs and Venus/Vulkan are outside current support."

msgid ""
"``tools/test_virtgpu_qemu.py`` 使用新建的私有测试目录启动真实来宾，可检查 "
"2D、VirGL、BIOS/UEFI、Xorg/IceWM/Fileman、控制台恢复、panic 及模块重载。 用匹配内核的 ``--module-root`` 指向 "
"modules_install 根目录验证 drm.ko。 EGL 探针通过 ``sh tools/build-virtgpu-egl-probe.sh ROOT OUTPUT`` 编译， "
"ROOT 须含完整来宾运行库；宿主只提供 EGL/GLES2/GBM 头文件，链接使用来宾库。 探针检查实际 renderer、着色器、三角形像素与销毁；打印的 64×64 离屏 draw "
"速率属于观察值，不能作为桌面 FPS。VMware 验证未完成。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_virtgpu_qemu.py`` boots a real guest in a new private test directory and checks 2D, "
"VirGL, BIOS/UEFI, Xorg/IceWM/Fileman, console restoration, panic and module reload. Point "
"``--module-root`` at the modules_install root from the matching kernel to test drm.ko. Build the "
"EGL probe with ``sh tools/build-virtgpu-egl-probe.sh ROOT OUTPUT``, where ROOT contains the "
"complete guest runtime libraries. The host supplies only EGL/GLES2/GBM headers; linking uses "
"guest libraries. The probe checks the actual renderer, shaders, triangle pixels and teardown. Its"
" reported 64×64 offscreen draw rate is an observation, not desktop FPS. VMware validation is "
"incomplete."

msgid "主题与菜单"
msgstr "Themes and Menus"

msgid ""
"XDM 使用 ``/etc/X11/xdm/`` 下的标准配置和 Xresources；IceWM 的背景、 颜色和装饰由 IceWM "
"主题决定。两者分别配置，不再强制使用同一张背景图片。 系统 IceWM 配置由 ``/etc/icewm`` 及 "
"``/etc/reliefos/icewm`` 提供， 用户的 ``~/.icewm/`` 可覆盖系统配置。主题不能替代菜单、工具栏与键位文件。"
msgstr ""
"XDM uses standard configuration and Xresources under ``/etc/X11/xdm/``; "
"IceWM backgrounds, colors, and decorations are controlled by IceWM themes. "
"They are configured separately and are no longer forced to share one "
"background image. System IceWM configuration comes from ``/etc/icewm`` and "
"``/etc/reliefos/icewm``; users can override it in ``~/.icewm/``. Themes do "
"not replace menu, toolbar, or key binding files."

msgid ""
"修改键位或会话配置后需要重新加载 IceWM 或重新登录。自定义菜单应保留按功能 分组的应用入口。Win+Shift+S 启动 "
"ReliefCapture；用户自定义 keys 覆盖默认键位时 需自行合并该绑定。"
msgstr ""
"Reload IceWM or log in again after changing key bindings or session "
"configuration. Custom menus should retain application entries grouped by "
"function. Win+Shift+S launches ReliefCapture; users whose custom keys file "
"overrides the defaults must merge this binding themselves."

msgid "用户目录与快捷方式"
msgstr "User Directories and Shortcuts"

msgid ""
"登录会话运行上游 ``xdg-user-dirs-update``，按用户语言初始化 Desktop、Documents、 Downloads "
"等目录。安装器和账户种子只准备主目录与配置模板，不再预建另一套目录。 Fileman 及下载路径读取 ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/user-"
"dirs.dirs``；未设置有效的 ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` 时使用 ``~/.config/user-dirs.dirs``。桌面由 "
"``XDG_DESKTOP_DIR`` 决定，下载位置由 ``XDG_DOWNLOAD_DIR`` 决定。未配置或 "
"禁用的特殊目录回退到主目录。配置只按路径数据读取，不执行其中的 shell 代码。"
msgstr ""
"The login session runs upstream ``xdg-user-dirs-update`` to initialize "
"Desktop, Documents, Downloads, and other directories according to the user's"
" language. The installer and account seed prepare only the home directory "
"and configuration templates; they no longer pre-create a separate directory "
"set. Fileman and download paths read ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/user-dirs.dirs``, or"
" ``~/.config/user-dirs.dirs`` if a valid ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` is not set. "
"``XDG_DESKTOP_DIR`` determines the desktop directory and "
"``XDG_DOWNLOAD_DIR`` the download location. Unconfigured or disabled special"
" directories fall back to the home directory. Configuration is read strictly"
" as path data; shell code in it is never executed."

msgid ""
"Fileman 的“创建快捷方式”可选择桌面或当前目录：应用使用标准 ``.desktop``， "
"已有应用启动项保留名称、图标、文件参数和终端设置；普通文件与文件夹使用 POSIX "
"符号链接。创建操作不覆盖同名文件，自动选择新的名称。打开应用启动项时复用系统 GLib ``gio launch``，由上游处理 Exec "
"转义、字段码、工作目录和终端启动规则。 IceWM 的应用菜单继续通过 ``icewm-menu-fdo`` 读取标准应用入口。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman's Create Shortcut action offers the desktop or current directory as "
"a destination. Applications use standard ``.desktop`` files; existing "
"application launchers retain their names, icons, file arguments, and "
"terminal settings. Regular files and folders use POSIX symbolic links. "
"Creation never overwrites an existing name and automatically selects a new "
"one. Opening an application launcher reuses the system GLib ``gio launch``, "
"leaving Exec escaping, field codes, working directories, and terminal launch"
" rules to upstream. IceWM's application menu continues to read standard "
"application entries through ``icewm-menu-fdo``."

msgid ""
"``~/.icewm`` 是窗口管理器配置目录，桌面图标的显示仍需独立图标管理器；创建 "
"快捷方式不会自动增加桌面图标服务。更新不会删除或移动用户已有文件或个人目录。 "
"旧版私有快捷方式不再解析；已有的此类快捷方式需重新创建为标准启动项或符号链接。"
msgstr ""
"``~/.icewm`` is the window manager's configuration directory. Displaying "
"desktop icons still requires a separate icon manager; creating shortcuts "
"does not automatically add a desktop icon service. Updates do not delete or "
"move users' existing files or personal directories. Legacy private shortcuts"
" are no longer parsed; recreate any such existing shortcuts as standard "
"launchers or symbolic links."

msgid "中文与故障排查"
msgstr "Chinese Support and Troubleshooting"

msgid ""
"原生 C++ 应用使用 FLTK gtk+ 控件、系统中文字体和 UTF-8。 显示字体、键盘布局和输入法是不同配置，见 "
":doc:`../userspace-api/locale`。 密码输入不能交给第三方输入法。"
msgstr ""
"Native C++ applications use FLTK gtk+ widgets, system Chinese fonts, and "
"UTF-8. Display fonts, keyboard layouts, and input methods are separate "
"settings; see :doc:`../userspace-api/locale`. Password input must not be "
"passed to third-party input methods."

msgid ""
"记录启动固件、CPU/内存、Xorg 日志、用户身份、主题和复现步骤。 通过 VT 切换或串口确认系统是否仍可调度，再区分 "
"Xorg、窗口管理器和应用故障。 编译压力下的拖动与硬关机后的锁文件问题见 :doc:`limitations`。"
msgstr ""
"Record the boot firmware, CPU/memory, Xorg logs, user identity, theme, and "
"reproduction steps. Use VT switching or serial output to check whether the "
"system can still schedule tasks, then distinguish between Xorg, window "
"manager, and application failures. For dragging under compilation load and "
"lock files left after a hard power-off, see :doc:`limitations`."

msgid "上游登录管理器的程序名为 ``xdm``；它与 IceWM 的会话和主题配置分别维护。"
msgstr ""
"The upstream display manager executable is named ``xdm``; its configuration "
"is maintained separately from IceWM's session and theme settings."

msgid "源码与兼容边界"
msgstr "Source Code and Compatibility Boundaries"

msgid ""
"系统只交付 Xorg、XDM、IceWM 和已迁移的图形应用。旧自研桌面、私有窗口 传输、对应 SDK 窗口头文件和 ELF "
"窗口接口均已删除，不提供兼容服务或空实现。 内核保留标准 framebuffer、DRM 和 evdev 设备接口，不再包含内置桌面绘制。"
msgstr ""
"The system ships only Xorg, XDM, IceWM, and graphical applications that have"
" been migrated. The old in-house desktop, private window transport, "
"corresponding SDK window headers, and ELF window interfaces have all been "
"removed; no compatibility service or stub implementation is provided. The "
"kernel retains standard framebuffer, DRM, and evdev device interfaces and no"
" longer includes built-in desktop drawing."

msgid ""
"尚未迁移的图形客户端源码继续保留在 ``userland/apps/``，但不在组件菜单、 构建清单、安装包或启动菜单中。终端使用 st，浏览器使用 "
"NetSurf。旧的设置、 设备管理及协议演示程序需迁移到 X11 后才能重新加入；保留源码不表示它们 "
"仍可编译或运行。第三方上游源码及其许可证保留，旧窗口平台适配层已移除。"
msgstr ""
"Source for graphical clients that have not yet been migrated remains in "
"``userland/apps/``, but they are absent from the component menu, build "
"manifest, packages, and launch menu. The terminal is st and the browser is "
"NetSurf. Legacy settings, device management, and protocol demonstration "
"programs must be migrated to X11 before they can be included again; retained"
" source does not imply that they still build or run. Third-party upstream "
"source and licenses are retained, while the old window platform adaptation "
"layer has been removed."

msgid ""
"这是旧图形 API 的破坏性移除。现有应用需迁移至 FLTK/X11；进程快照、 CPU 亲和性和单调时钟声明位于 "
"``<reliefos/system.h>``，独立 framebuffer 辅助接口位于 ``<reliefos/fb.h>``。重新生成 SDK "
"并重新链接应用，不要混用旧库。"
msgstr ""
"This is a breaking removal of the old graphical API. Existing applications "
"must migrate to FLTK/X11. Process snapshot, CPU affinity, and monotonic "
"clock declarations are in ``<reliefos/system.h>``, and independent "
"framebuffer helpers are in ``<reliefos/fb.h>``. Regenerate the SDK and "
"relink applications; do not mix in old libraries."
